# the TypeSafe pink theme (TUI-DESIGN-3 §2, D-H) under TERM=xterm-256color: the first frame carries the primary pink `38;5;211` (the badge,
# the idle prompt, the wordmark letters) and none of round 2's cyan `38;5;117`; after `[run] start` the console edges take the secondary
# pink `38;5;169` and none of round 2's `38;5;74`; run-smoke.sh greps the raw capture
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect Say hi
expect sess \$
sleep 0.3
send fix the failing test
sleep 0.2
send \r
expect \[run\](?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)* start 
mark started
expect end (complete|max_steps|generator_done)
expect Follow-up, question
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
